SUMMARY:Live@DCC Free Noon Concert - Yolo Hot Club!
DESCRIPTION:Come cool your heels and enjoy the Yolo Hot Club on Friday\, July 10\, noon – 1:00! Yolo Hot Club is a jazz manouche or gypsy jazz instrumental string trio\, in the style of the Parisian hot jazz clubs of the 1930s and 40s.
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/livedcc-free-noon-concert-yolo-hot-club/
