SUMMARY:Yolo Community Band presents "Musical Screenshots: Anime to Video Games"
DESCRIPTION:Join the Yolo Community Band on July 10 at 7:00 PM for “Musical Screenshots: Anime to Video Games” at the Woodland Opera House! Under the direction of Michael Loya\, this family-friendly concert will bring iconic music from beloved Studio Ghibli films (including My Neighbor Totoro and Howl’s Moving Castle) to life\, alongside unforgettable themes from favorite video games like Halo\, Minecraft\, and more.\nPerfect for audiences of all ages\, this affordable community concert is a summer favorite and often sells out.\nSecure your seats today at www.WoodlandOperaHouse.org! Adults (16 and over) $15; Seniors (65 and over)/Youth (under 16) $10; Balcony seating $10; Children under 3 free.
